# Force LF on files that must stay LF to build/run on Linux (Docker hosts, VMs),
# regardless of a contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Protects both the WebDAV
# (CVE-2026-58415) and Digest (CVE-2026-73636) labs.
*.sh         text eol=lf
*.py         text eol=lf
*.conf       text eol=lf
Dockerfile   text eol=lf
Dockerfile*  text eol=lf
